{"table":"nodes","ref":"sha256:c941bb8e2efcb2c545fdebbfec6f904193275455192bec48bcb452c5b8ab7f97/nodes/scalar.lean_parisi_target","record":{"id":"scalar.lean_parisi_target","kind":"declaration","label":"OAI.SKValue.ground_state_parisi_target","status":"unverified","source_id":"scalar-r2-26-source-formal-targets","locator":"GroundState/MainConclusions.lean:25–27; ground_state_parisi_target","statement":"For every W:BrownianSpace and gamma:OrderParameter, IsMinimizer W gamma implies groundStateValue=parisi W gamma. No X or IsDiffusion hypothesis is supplied by the caller; the proof uses diffusionProcess_isDiffusion W gamma.","assumption_ids":["assumptions.value_minimizer"],"evidence_ids":[],"citation_ids":["scalar-r2-26-cite-lean-parisi-target"],"boundary":"The exact SKValue model uses a coefficient on all reals with its stated interval fields, BrownianSpace and its natural filtration. Source inspected; no kernel replay, Comparator acceptance or elaborated dependency extraction is recorded.","declaration":"OAI.SKValue.ground_state_parisi_target"},"usage":{"record_ref":"sha256:c941bb8e2efcb2c545fdebbfec6f904193275455192bec48bcb452c5b8ab7f97/nodes/scalar.lean_parisi_target","paper_focus":[],"paper_memberships":[{"stage":"long","subgraph_ref":"sha256:7588abc48d1c21bb64c366849eaa851938d6acc6b17cf16f89ccf8b87ca26853/papers/long.json/support/0.3.1/69473417dc487cafa5e2e39b3168d2c4a8bffdad2e91b6e486de48f122dda071","roles":["mapped_claim"]},{"stage":"short","subgraph_ref":"sha256:b3fb22a55f09aba18f53cd9bbac859142355ee389bba5aa7bf98d016dc611a43/papers/short.json/support/0.3.1/77f0cf29ab577b42d8caa5b2831ebfb1ca170d4b13c1ef6897cadc8e93c2a834","roles":["recorded_prerequisite"]},{"stage":"expository","subgraph_ref":"sha256:082c1187f897999ee934fa70dbb519221ed1e0aebc169fac91b7211a4a599dc5/papers/expository.json/support/0.3.1/9dd5536bc567fc55efaa864733bf89747cea0268a8a3865dec51ddd8e2a235dd","roles":["recorded_prerequisite"]}],"direct_passages":[{"stage":"long","passage_ref":"sha256:9e0f6d255eb0a116c513a0c11e94d28559f0a429ef365c3137bb4ff3b6a061d6/papers/long.md/sha256:7588abc48d1c21bb64c366849eaa851938d6acc6b17cf16f89ccf8b87ca26853/papers/long.json/passages/formal-parisi-clause","anchor":"formal-parisi-clause","mapping_ref":"sha256:7588abc48d1c21bb64c366849eaa851938d6acc6b17cf16f89ccf8b87ca26853/papers/long.json","mapping_field":"claim_ids"}]},"aligned_passages":[{"stage":"long","passage_ref":"sha256:9e0f6d255eb0a116c513a0c11e94d28559f0a429ef365c3137bb4ff3b6a061d6/papers/long.md/sha256:7588abc48d1c21bb64c366849eaa851938d6acc6b17cf16f89ccf8b87ca26853/papers/long.json/passages/formal-parisi-clause","anchor":"formal-parisi-clause","mapping_ref":"sha256:7588abc48d1c21bb64c366849eaa851938d6acc6b17cf16f89ccf8b87ca26853/papers/long.json","mapping_field":"claim_ids","text":"\n<a id=\"formal-parisi-clause\"></a>\n\nThe third declaration, `ground_state_parisi_target`, assumes a minimizer\nalone and concludes $P_*=\\mathcal P(\\gamma)$. Its proof chooses\n$X=\\texttt{diffusionProcess}\\ W\\ \\gamma$ and proves the diffusion\npredicate for that process before applying the equality with a supplied\ndiffusion. No diffusion is required from the caller, and none of these\nclauses constructs a minimizer. The exact declarations are\n[MainConclusions, lines 13–27][scalar-main-conclusions]; their analytic\nsuppliers and applications are in [ContactAssembly][scalar-contact-assembly].\nThe independent contact and lower-bound arguments are reconstructed in\n[§10.1](#formal-scalar-contact) and [§10.2](#independent-scalar-lower-bound).\n","span":{"start_byte":231910,"end_byte":232654,"start_line":4987,"end_line":4999},"paper_href":"/api/v1/papers/long?manifest=79bf16ac8ab3a2adf5741ab97b2e4bd813e1c0a1940efbbdf9e35523f00de8bb","reading_href":"/api/v1/papers/reading?manifest=79bf16ac8ab3a2adf5741ab97b2e4bd813e1c0a1940efbbdf9e35523f00de8bb&paper=long&passage=formal-parisi-clause","query_href":"/api/v1/papers/query?manifest=79bf16ac8ab3a2adf5741ab97b2e4bd813e1c0a1940efbbdf9e35